{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Av.Format</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"ffmpeg-av","href":"../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Av","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Format","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>FFmpeg's input and output formats: demuxers, muxers and devices. A format value is a handle on a static FFmpeg object and needs no release.</p>","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-get_input_name\"><a href=\"#val-get_input_name\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> get_input_name : <span><span><span>(<a href=\"../../../ffmpeg-avutil/Avutil/index.html#type-input\">Avutil.input</a>, <span class=\"type-var\">_</span>)</span> <a href=\"../../../ffmpeg-avutil/Avutil/index.html#type-format\">Avutil.format</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> string</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The name of an input format. It may be a comma-separated list of aliases.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-get_input_long_name\"><a href=\"#val-get_input_long_name\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> get_input_long_name : <span><span><span>(<a href=\"../../../ffmpeg-avutil/Avutil/index.html#type-input\">Avutil.input</a>, <span class=\"type-var\">_</span>)</span> <a href=\"../../../ffmpeg-avutil/Avutil/index.html#type-format\">Avutil.format</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> string</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The descriptive name of an input format.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-input_ts_discont\"><a href=\"#val-input_ts_discont\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> input_ts_discont : <span><span><span>(<a href=\"../../../ffmpeg-avutil/Avutil/index.html#type-input\">Avutil.input</a>, <span class=\"type-var\">_</span>)</span> <a href=\"../../../ffmpeg-avutil/Avutil/index.html#type-format\">Avutil.format</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Whether the input format declares timestamp discontinuities legitimate (FFmpeg's <code>AVFMT_TS_DISCONT</code> flag), as MPEG-TS does.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-get_output_name\"><a href=\"#val-get_output_name\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> get_output_name : <span><span><span>(<a href=\"../../../ffmpeg-avutil/Avutil/index.html#type-output\">Avutil.output</a>, <span class=\"type-var\">_</span>)</span> <a href=\"../../../ffmpeg-avutil/Avutil/index.html#type-format\">Avutil.format</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> string</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The name of an output format. It may be a comma-separated list of aliases.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-get_output_long_name\"><a href=\"#val-get_output_long_name\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> get_output_long_name : <span><span><span>(<a href=\"../../../ffmpeg-avutil/Avutil/index.html#type-output\">Avutil.output</a>, <span class=\"type-var\">_</span>)</span> <a href=\"../../../ffmpeg-avutil/Avutil/index.html#type-format\">Avutil.format</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> string</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The descriptive name of an output format.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-find_input_format\"><a href=\"#val-find_input_format\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> find_input_format : <span>string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span><span>(<a href=\"../../../ffmpeg-avutil/Avutil/index.html#type-input\">Avutil.input</a>, <span class=\"type-var\">'a</span>)</span> <a href=\"../../../ffmpeg-avutil/Avutil/index.html#type-format\">Avutil.format</a></span> option</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>find_input_format name</code> is FFmpeg's input format of that short name, or <code>None</code> when there is none. The media parameter of the result is chosen by the caller and is not checked.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-guess_output_format\"><a href=\"#val-guess_output_format\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> guess_output_format : \u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?short_name</span>:string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?filename</span>:string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?mime</span>:string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span>unit <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><span>(<a href=\"../../../ffmpeg-avutil/Avutil/index.html#type-output\">Avutil.output</a>, <span class=\"type-var\">'a</span>)</span> <a href=\"../../../ffmpeg-avutil/Avutil/index.html#type-format\">Avutil.format</a></span> option</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>FFmpeg's guess of an output format. The media parameter of the result is chosen by the caller and is not checked.</p><ul class=\"at-tags\"><li class=\"parameter\"><span class=\"at-tag\">parameter</span> <span class=\"value\">short_name</span> <p>a format short name, such as <code>&quot;mp4&quot;</code>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"at-tags\"><li class=\"parameter\"><span class=\"at-tag\">parameter</span> <span class=\"value\">filename</span> <p>a file name.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"at-tags\"><li class=\"parameter\"><span class=\"at-tag\">parameter</span> <span class=\"value\">mime</span> <p>a MIME type.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"at-tags\"><li class=\"returns\"><span class=\"at-tag\">returns</span> <p><code>None</code> when FFmpeg guesses nothing. An omitted or empty argument does not take part in the guess.</p></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-get_audio_codec_id\"><a href=\"#val-get_audio_codec_id\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> get_audio_codec_id : \u000A  <span><span><span>(<a href=\"../../../ffmpeg-avutil/Avutil/index.html#type-output\">Avutil.output</a>, <a href=\"../../../ffmpeg-avutil/Avutil/index.html#type-audio\">Avutil.audio</a>)</span> <a href=\"../../../ffmpeg-avutil/Avutil/index.html#type-format\">Avutil.format</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <a href=\"../../../ffmpeg-avcodec/Avcodec/Audio/index.html#type-id\">Avcodec.Audio.id</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The default audio codec of the format; <code>`None</code> when it has none.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-get_video_codec_id\"><a href=\"#val-get_video_codec_id\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> get_video_codec_id : \u000A  <span><span><span>(<a href=\"../../../ffmpeg-avutil/Avutil/index.html#type-output\">Avutil.output</a>, <a href=\"../../../ffmpeg-avutil/Avutil/index.html#type-video\">Avutil.video</a>)</span> <a href=\"../../../ffmpeg-avutil/Avutil/index.html#type-format\">Avutil.format</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <a href=\"../../../ffmpeg-avcodec/Avcodec/Video/index.html#type-id\">Avcodec.Video.id</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The default video codec of the format; <code>`None</code> when it has none.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-get_subtitle_codec_id\"><a href=\"#val-get_subtitle_codec_id\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> get_subtitle_codec_id : \u000A  <span><span><span>(<a href=\"../../../ffmpeg-avutil/Avutil/index.html#type-output\">Avutil.output</a>, <a href=\"../../../ffmpeg-avutil/Avutil/index.html#type-subtitle\">Avutil.subtitle</a>)</span> <a href=\"../../../ffmpeg-avutil/Avutil/index.html#type-format\">Avutil.format</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <a href=\"../../../ffmpeg-avcodec/Avcodec/Subtitle/index.html#type-id\">Avcodec.Subtitle.id</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The default subtitle codec of the format; <code>`None</code> when it has none.</p></div></div>"}